  objectiveText: Return to the Ship
  introText: "The station is tearing itself apart. Carry the replacement engine together
    all the way back to your ship \u2014 across collapsing bridges, falling cables
    and a gravity ring.\n\nKeep it level: tilting or hard landings shake the engine
    loose."
  completeTitle: ENGINE ONLINE
  completeText: 'The new engine roars to life. With the station collapsing behind
    you, the ship breaks free and turns for home.


    Thanks for playing BORROWED
    GRAVITY!'
  isFinalStage: 1
  holdToResetSeconds: 1
  playAmbience: 1
